<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμετωπ-ίδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before</i> or <i>on the
				forehead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.479
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῖχος</span>”
				<i>in front,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.11.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμετωπίδιον, τό,</span>
			<i>skin of the forehead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμετωπίδια ἵππων ἐκδεδαρμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.70
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>frontpiece, frontlet,</i> esp. for horses, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.8.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.4.1
			</span></i> (but <i>chest-piece,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				34.8
			</span></i>); also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος χρυσοῦς . . ἔχων
				π.</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1652.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>skull</i> of an ox, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				21.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βοῶν</span>
			<u>Chron.Lind.</u>C.<i><span class="en">
				110
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
